<title>POLAND: Rafako trade suspended on Friday.</title>
<headline>Rafako trade suspended on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw bourse has suspended trade in industrial boilermaker Rafako SA on Friday, a bourse representative said, adding that more details would be provided in a statement later in the day.</p>
<p>On Thursday the bourse suspended for an indefinite period of time electrode maker ZEW, also based in the southern town of Raciborz, due to flooding in the region.</p>
<p>Rafako officials could not be reached for comment on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
